#: ../../source/docs/common-synerex-mdu-2000.rst:11
#: 837ca624e53e486d866ed8227ff4a7b1
msgid ""
"MDU-2000 UAV Kit is a GNSS RTK receiver for UAV with dual antenna support "
"that provides centimeter-level position and heading in real time. MBC RTK "
"service guarantees less than 3cm latitude/longitude error and 10cm altitude "
"error. It supports azimuth using dual antenna RTK technology instead of "
"conventional external COMPASS, which is greatly affected by metals or "
"electromagnetic fields, enabling more stable flight near high-voltage power "
"lines and large structures."
msgstr ""
"MDU-2000 UAV 套件是一款支持双天线的无人机 GNSS RTK 接收机，可实时提供厘米级定位和航向。MBC RTK 服务保证纬度/经度误差小于"
" 3cm，高度误差小于 10cm。它通过双天线 RTK "
"技术提供方位角，取代了易受金属或电磁场干扰的传统外部罗盘，使飞行器在高压线和大型建筑附近更稳定地飞行。"

